 "source": ";; quote, quasiquote, unquote, unquote-splicing. Each is its own node\n;; wrapping a datum, not a list headed by the word quote.\n(define quoted '(a b c)) ; quote\n\n(define nested-quote '(a(c d)) e))\n\n(define (fill-template x ys)\n`(+ ,x ,@ys))\n\n(define (build xs)\n`(begin\n,@xs\nx))\n",
